# UI craft — ProductName ambient dock

When changing dock UI, read and obey:

1. [`design-system/productname/MASTER.md`](design-system/productname/MASTER.md) — tokens, type, anti-patterns
2. [`docs/design/ambient-dock-ui.md`](docs/design/ambient-dock-ui.md) — geometry, states, glass rules

## Must

- Keep the frosted corner sticky note (never a normal app window / SaaS dashboard)
- Load Source Serif 4 + IBM Plex Sans/Mono for real (no Inter / Geist / system-only primary)
- Ink cobalt accent (`--accent` / `#6B8CFF`); surface ladder `--surface-0/1/2`
- Sentence-case titles; serif for “Today” / ProductName; mono for due times / ledger
- Thin SVG icons only (`app/src/components/Icons.tsx` pattern)
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`; prefer opacity/transform transitions — never `transition-all`

## Must not

- Purple / pink / indigo gradients; mint/teal AI-HUD accent (`#5fd6ae`)
- 3-up feature card grids; `rounded-2xl` monoculture; glow orbs; emoji icons
- Uppercase + tracking HUD section labels
- Opaque solid fills on `.dock` / overlays (translucent tint + blur only)
